(7666936, 1250962, 153275, '<td valign="top">Nice low-saturated shot. Good choice of the font, looks very Irish/celtic as well.</td>', 'Nice low-saturated shot. Good choice of the font, looks very Irish/celtic as well.', '2020-06-19 07:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7666937, 1250637, 153275, '<td valign="top">Beautiful postcard, not one of these tourist cards people sent from their holiday address but more one of the arty-types, I would send it to a friend for a birthday or so. Nice structure of the wall and paving, low contrasts but the red flowers really pop.</td>', 'Beautiful postcard, not one of these tourist cards people sent from their holiday address but more one of the arty-types, I would send it to a friend for a birthday or so. Nice structure of the wall and paving, low contrasts but the red flowers really pop.', '2020-06-19 07:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7666939, 1250948, 153275, '<td valign="top">Neat postcard. I didn''t deduct points for the cheap and ugly border because that''s what each self-respecting postcard should have as a minimum (no offending intended ;-)<br/>Only nitpick is the I don''t really like the text color and font</td>', 'Neat postcard. I didn''t deduct points for the cheap and ugly border because that''s what each self-respecting postcard should have as a minimum (no offending intended ;-)Only nitpick is the I don''t really like the text color and font', '2020-06-19 07:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7666940, 1250967, 153275, '<td valign="top">Nice postcard and the scene is cute. The border really makes this a postcard!</td>', 'Nice postcard and the scene is cute. The border really makes this a postcard!', '2020-06-19 07:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7666941, 1250675, 153275, '<td valign="top">Nice triptych, well balanced. This really has a postcard look&amp;feel</td>', 'Nice triptych, well balanced. This really has a postcard look&feel', '2020-06-19 07:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7666943, 1250972, 153275, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, credible as a postcard. The 3 details at the bottom make this, otherwise it would have been pretty boring except for the golden dome. (which is however not uncommon for a postcard)</td>', 'Nicely done, credible as a postcard. The 3 details at the bottom make this, otherwise it would have been pretty boring except for the golden dome. (which is however not uncommon for a postcard)', '2020-06-19 07:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7666957, 1250927, 153275, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, and yes this says ''postcard'' to me. This is one I would send to family during my holidays (and otherwise, my wife would as she loves horses).</td>', 'Beautiful shot, and yes this says ''postcard'' to me. This is one I would send to family during my holidays (and otherwise, my wife would as she loves horses).', '2020-06-19 08:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7666958, 1250631, 153275, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, and yes this says ''postcard'' to me. This is one I would send to family during my holidays. I imagine myself walking down that path... unfortunately no mountain hiking for me this year as the covid situation keeps me in my own country this year. Luckily the mountains will be there for a while...</td>', 'Beautiful shot, and yes this says ''postcard'' to me. This is one I would send to family during my holidays. I imagine myself walking down that path... unfortunately no mountain hiking for me this year as the covid situation keeps me in my own country this year. Luckily the mountains will be there for a while...', '2020-06-19 08:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7666975, 1250624, 153275, '<td valign="top">Nice postcard shot although the background hills are a little boring especially as there is little contrast with the cloudy sky. A more sunny, blue sky eventually taken with a polariser (as seen in so many totally over-the-top postcards in the real world) may give this more of a postcard look.<br/>Funny to see how the tower crane blends in, white in front of the church wall and (mostly) red in front of the roof, and due to the perfect alignment with it, it looks like the white parts of the jib are actually part of the roof structure.</td>', 'Nice postcard shot although the background hills are a little boring especially as there is little contrast with the cloudy sky. A more sunny, blue sky eventually taken with a polariser (as seen in so many totally over-the-top postcards in the real world) may give this more of a postcard look.Funny to see how the tower crane blends in, white in front of the church wall and (mostly) red in front of the roof, and due to the perfect alignment with it, it looks like the white parts of the jib are actually part of the roof structure.', '2020-06-19 09:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7666976, 1250977, 52549, '<td valign="top">Very, very pretty. I think you meant greetings...</td>', 'Very, very pretty. I think you meant greetings...', '2020-06-19 09:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
