(7667012, 1250970, 153275, '<td valign="top">Do they have a post office there? <br/> <br/>I once sent a postcard from a distant mountain refugee... the owner offered to post it for me so I didn''t have to carry it in my backpack for a couple of days. It happened to be the case that he kept his word but not earlier than after the summer season was over and he descended so it took a couple of months to arrive. But I guess that''s nothing compared to a postcard sent from this spot ;-)</td>', 'Do they have a post office there?  I once sent a postcard from a distant mountain refugee... the owner offered to post it for me so I didn''t have to carry it in my backpack for a couple of days. It happened to be the case that he kept his word but not earlier than after the summer season was over and he descended so it took a couple of months to arrive. But I guess that''s nothing compared to a postcard sent from this spot ;-)', '2020-06-19 10:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7667013, 1250883, 153275, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Pity about the text bar at the bottom I would have liked it more without that</td>', 'Nice shot. Pity about the text bar at the bottom I would have liked it more without that', '2020-06-19 10:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7667014, 1250558, 153275, '<td valign="top">Zaandam?</td>', 'Zaandam?', '2020-06-19 10:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7667015, 1250748, 153275, '<td valign="top">Nice vivid colors except for the building at the right side which is a bit too dark. Pity the picture is so small it''s better to use the full 1200 px for the longest edge. Composition-wise I would have liked it more to have the big piece laundry out of the centre of the shot either by taking a higher or lower stand, or move to the right.</td>', 'Nice vivid colors except for the building at the right side which is a bit too dark. Pity the picture is so small it''s better to use the full 1200 px for the longest edge. Composition-wise I would have liked it more to have the big piece laundry out of the centre of the shot either by taking a higher or lower stand, or move to the right.', '2020-06-19 10:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7667016, 1250641, 153275, '<td valign="top">beautiful colors. For me the view is enough as a postcard. The text and border do not add anything here i.m.o. Especially "Arizona" looks like a big graffiti. Must have been those vandalists again... always the same... ;-)</td>', 'beautiful colors. For me the view is enough as a postcard. The text and border do not add anything here i.m.o. Especially "Arizona" looks like a big graffiti. Must have been those vandalists again... always the same... ;-)', '2020-06-19 10:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7667017, 1250963, 153275, '<td valign="top">Neat shot. The text suggest a travel brochure or flyer more than a postcard.</td>', 'Neat shot. The text suggest a travel brochure or flyer more than a postcard.', '2020-06-19 10:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7667018, 1250975, 153275, '<td valign="top">Excellent! I consider this a parody on the ugliness of so many postcards in the world. A non-descriptive background and pictures too small to actually depicture what''s there. The lettering ''artwork'' makes it complete. I totally imagine this in a postcard rack next to the door of a souvenir shop, sun bleached since 1988 because no-one buys and sends it. <br/> <br/>(I hope I''m not wrong and have totally offended you by now... if so sorry it''s not my intention)</td>', 'Excellent! I consider this a parody on the ugliness of so many postcards in the world. A non-descriptive background and pictures too small to actually depicture what''s there. The lettering ''artwork'' makes it complete. I totally imagine this in a postcard rack next to the door of a souvenir shop, sun bleached since 1988 because no-one buys and sends it.  (I hope I''m not wrong and have totally offended you by now... if so sorry it''s not my intention)', '2020-06-19 10:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7667164, 1250975, 65234, '<td valign="top">So well done. Very creative to use pictures in your letters and you chose a great background. But then I''m partial to the Shenandoah Valley, which is what this looks like. This is my top pick in this challenge.</td>', 'So well done. Very creative to use pictures in your letters and you chose a great background. But then I''m partial to the Shenandoah Valley, which is what this looks like. This is my top pick in this challenge.', '2020-06-20 12:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7667165, 1250938, 65234, '<td valign="top">LOL! Love the flamingo. Well done. Only nit is that the space between the text and its shadow feels like it''s moving, and not in a good way. Makes me feel a little dizzy!</td>', 'LOL! Love the flamingo. Well done. Only nit is that the space between the text and its shadow feels like it''s moving, and not in a good way. Makes me feel a little dizzy!', '2020-06-20 12:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7667166, 1250968, 65234, '<td valign="top">Beautifully composed and a classic Paris image. The duotone and elegant lettering make for a very classy feel, which suits the subject perfectly.</td>', 'Beautifully composed and a classic Paris image. The duotone and elegant lettering make for a very classy feel, which suits the subject perfectly.', '2020-06-20 12:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
